<title>UK: London silver fixes at highest level since July 7.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes at highest level since July 7.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixed at 436.25 cents vs 434.50 cents previously. Highest fixing since July 7. Rose with gold, PGMs overnight. Needs to break 440 cents to open upside.</p>
<p>GOLD - Steady at $327.60/$327.90 vs $327.25/$327.75 close. Awaiting OTC option expiry. Near top of range.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - About $3.00 lower at $426.00/$429.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Down $4.00 at $197.00/$200.00.</p>
</text>
